Experimental patches ported onto 0548f0b2300d + local slop optimizations.

Sources (retrieved 2026-10-20):
https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/16598
https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/15794
https://github.com/DeterminateSystems/nix-src/pull/646
https://github.com/DeterminateSystems/nix-src/pull/710
https://github.com/DeterminateSystems/nix-src/pull/611

Porting: preserve mutable BindingsBuilder API while finalizing lazy size;
retain atomic memoization and finished flag; move aterm.cc changes into
derivations.cc; adapt forceValueDeep context. No #706 progress TUI.

